        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Heaven's Thunder"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(electricity, evocation, sonic, verbal)\n\nFrequency: 2/day\n\nWith a loud shout, Shristi unleashes his ki as a crackling shroud of thunder and lightning that engulfs his body. Until the end of his next turn, Shristi's unarmed Strikes and Strikes with weapons that have the monk trait deal an additional 3 electricity damage and 3 sonic damage."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "one_action"
            },
